Title: THE SUMMIT AT BLACKWOOD MANOR
Credit: written by
Author: Storyboard AI Table Read Studio
Notes: 6-Character Voice Ensemble (Alloy, Echo, Fable, Onyx, Nova, Shimmer)

INT. BLACKWOOD MANOR - LIBRARY - NIGHT

A stormy tempest rattles the leaded glass windows. Lightning illuminates a mahogany council table where SIX FIGURES sit with sealed envelopes.

ARTHUR [Voice: Onyx]
(authoritative baritone)
Thank you all for braving the storm. The founder's will is unequivocal. Before dawn, one of us must assume total control of the syndicate.

BEATRICE [Voice: Shimmer]
(smooth, elegant, laced with poison)
Let us not pretend this is about governance, Arthur. We are here because father hid the Swiss ledger codes, and you cannot decipher them alone.

CEDRIC [Voice: Echo]
(anxious, rapid tempo)
The ledger codes were compromised thirty minutes ago! Look at the fiber monitoring feed! The servers in Zurich are being wiped!

DIANA [Voice: Nova]
(commanding, razor-sharp)
Silence, Cedric. Nobody touches Zurich until I confirm the naval shipments cleared Rotterdam.

FINN [Voice: Alloy]
(youthful, daring, casual)
Rotterdam is already underwater, Diana. I diverted the cargo to Singapore two hours before the storm made landfall.

GWEN [Voice: Fable]
(mysterious, melodic, whisper)
None of your cargo matters. Look at the grandfather clock. The pendulum stopped five minutes ago. The room is locked from the outside.

ARTHUR [Voice: Onyx]
(standing abruptly)
Gwen, what did you put in the wine?
